; The tape shim as an opam-level replacement for upstream
; splittable_random: the PATCHED upstream implementation (sr_real.ml,
; carrying the Intercept seam), the Splittable_random shim module that
; re-exports it and adds For_tape, and the Tape choice-tape core --
; all in one (wrapped false) library so that `(libraries
; splittable_random)` exposes modules Splittable_random, Sr_real and
; Tape at top level.
(library
 (name splittable_random)
 (public_name splittable_random)
 (wrapped false)
 (modules sr_real splittable_random tape)
 (libraries base)
 (preprocess
  (pps ppx_sexp_message)))
